{"id":"fdd9f7cf9e95c90e","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-scale-on-set.md","title":"ZFC Scale On Set","display":"df-zfc-scale-on-set — ZFC Scale On Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-scale-on-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-scale-on-set"],"display":"df-zfc-scale-on-set — ZFC Scale On Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-zfc-norm-on-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-scale-on-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-scale-on-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-scale-on-set — ZFC Scale On Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a2a7a8614871e68\" href=\"?note=4a2a7a8614871e68\" title=\"58-df-zfc-norm-on-set\">58-df-zfc-norm-on-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\vec\\varphi\\in V\">\\(A,\\vec\\varphi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4a2a7a8614871e68\" href=\"?note=4a2a7a8614871e68\" title=\"58-df-zfc-norm-on-set\">58-df-zfc-norm-on-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScaleOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ScaleOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}scale\\text{-}on\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ScaleOnSet}_S(A,\\vec\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi,\\omega,B)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\vec\\varphi(n),A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\vec x,x,\\vec\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec x,\\omega,A)\n\\land x\\in\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\lambda,\\omega,\\lambda)\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n(k_0\\in k\\lor k_0=k)\n\\to\\vec x(k)\\upharpoonright m=x\\upharpoonright m\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n(k_0\\in k\\lor k_0=k)\n\\to\\vec\\varphi(n)(\\vec x(k))=\\vec\\lambda(n)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to x\\in A\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)\\in\\vec\\lambda(n)\n\\lor\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)=\\vec\\lambda(n)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}scale\\text{-}on\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ScaleOnSet}_S(A,\\vec\\varphi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi,\\omega,B)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\vec\\varphi(n),A)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\vec x,x,\\vec\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec x,\\omega,A)\n\\land x\\in\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\lambda,\\omega,\\lambda)\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n(k_0\\in k\\lor k_0=k)\n\\to\\vec x(k)\\upharpoonright m=x\\upharpoonright m\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n(k_0\\in k\\lor k_0=k)\n\\to\\vec\\varphi(n)(\\vec x(k))=\\vec\\lambda(n)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\to x\\in A\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)\\in\\vec\\lambda(n)\n\\lor\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)=\\vec\\lambda(n)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Convergence in Baire space is expanded as eventual agreement on every finite initial segment; ordinal sequences are set functions into a bounding ordinal, not functions into the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Both eventuality and rank comparison use the native ordinal membership order, eliminating two unregistered generic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> relations.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-norm-on-set","status":"resolved","id":"4a2a7a8614871e68","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-norm-on-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]]) and $\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-function]]) and $\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-norm-on-set","status":"resolved","id":"4a2a7a8614871e68","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-norm-on-set]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\vec\\varphi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}:V\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScaleOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}scale\\text{-}on\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ScaleOnSet}_S(A,\\vec\\varphi)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\exists B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\varphi,\\omega,B)\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{NormOnSet}_S(\\vec\\varphi(n),A)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\vec x,x,\\vec\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec x,\\omega,A)\n\\land x\\in\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\lambda)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\lambda,\\omega,\\lambda)\n\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall m\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n(k_0\\in k\\lor k_0=k)\n\\to\\vec x(k)\\upharpoonright m=x\\upharpoonright m\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\exists k_0\\in\\omega\\;\\forall k\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n(k_0\\in k\\lor k_0=k)\n\\to\\vec\\varphi(n)(\\vec x(k))=\\vec\\lambda(n)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\hspace{8em}\\to x\\in A\n\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)\\in\\vec\\lambda(n)\n\\lor\\vec\\varphi(n)(x)=\\vec\\lambda(n)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false}],"bytes":2034,"backlinks":[{"id":"4add5d1e34be6e1c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ScaleOnSet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-zfc-scale-on-set]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3336","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-scale-on-set.md|58-df-zfc-scale-on-set]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2","4a2a7a8614871e68"]}